on plus"}, {"start": 427.72, "duration": 1.12, "text": "ne s'amusent pas non plus"}, {"start": 428.84, "duration": 1.0, "text": "à pousser les bécanes."}, {"start": 429.84, "duration": 1.16, "text": "Ça m'a roulé un peu quand même,"}, {"start": 431.0, "duration": 0.68, "text": "ils ont l'habitude."}, {"start": 432.52, "duration": 0.36, "text": "Donc voilà,"}, {"start": 433.12, "duration": 2.04, "text": "si ils ont roulé"}, {"start": 435.16, "duration": 0.6, "text": "et que les pneus"}, {"start": 435.76, "duration": 1.0, "text": "ont fait 10 000 bornes,"}, {"start": 436.76, "duration": 0.2, "text": "bon,"}, {"start": 437.12, "duration": 0.6, "text": "c'est qu'apparemment"}, {"start": 437.72, "duration": 0.76, "text": "on a un pneu qui tient."}, {"start": 438.72, "duration": 0.24, "text": "Alors,"}, {"start": 438.96, "duration": 0.56, "text": "c'est justement"}, {"start": 439.52, "duration": 0.68, "text": "la promesse"}, {"start": 440.2, "duration": 1.24, "text": "de chez Bridgestone."}, {"start": 441.44, "duration": 1.8, "text": "C'est un pneu"}, {"start": 443.24, "duration": 4.56, "text": "je sais plus... mais plus de 40%"}, {"start": 448.12, "duration": 1.76, "text": "de durahabilité"}, {"start": 449.92, "duration": 2.24, "text": "que le T32."}, {"start": 454.16, "duration": 0.24, "text": "Alors,"}, {"start": 454.4, "duration": 0.32, "text": "je ne connais pas"}, {"start": 454.72, "duration": 0.56, "text": "le T32,"}, {"start": 455.48, "duration": 1.4, "text": "le Battlax T32,"}, {"start": 456.88, "duration": 0.64, "text": "je ne connais pas."}, {"start": 458.36, "duration": 0.12, "text": "Mais,"}, {"start": 458.48, "duration": 0.76, "text": "un retour là-dessus."}, {"start": 460.2, "duration": 0.28, "text": "Alors,"}, {"start": 460.48, "duration": 1.0, "text": "si j'arrive à passer"}, {"start": 461.48, "duration": 0.8, "text": "les 7 000 bornes,"}, {"start": 462.28, "duration": 0.96, "text": "c'est un excellent pneu,"}, {"start": 463.4, "duration": 0.76, "text": "je vous le dirai."}, {"start": 465.76, "duration": 0.24, "text": "Alors,"}, {"start": 466.0, "duration": 0.36, "text": "il faudrait quand même"}, {"start": 466.36, "duration": 0.68, "text": "que ça tienne un peu"}, {"start": 467.04, "duration": 0.92, "text": "parce que je roule doucement"}, {"start": 467.96, "duration": 0.12, "text": "là,"}, {"start": 468.08, "duration": 0.2, "text": "en fait,"}, {"start": 468.28, "duration": 0.4, "text": "je fais gaffe."}, {"start": 468.96, "duration": 0.8, "text": "parce que,"}, {"start": 470.72, "duration": 0.96, "text": "comment dire,"}, {"start": 471.92, "duration": 1.48, "text": "je pars dans un mois et demi"}, {"start": 473.4, "duration": 1.32, "text": "et il faudrait quand même"}, {"start": 474.72, "duration": 0.68, "text": "que j'arrive à faire tour"}, {"start": 475.4, "duration": 0.4, "text": "avec les pneus"}, {"start": 475.8, "duration": 0.4, "text": "parce que là,"}, {"start": 476.2, "duration": 0.96, "text": "je vais encore me faire allumer."}, {"start": 478.72, "duration": 0.64, "text": "Je voudrais quand même"}, {"start": 479.36, "duration": 1.12, "text": "éviter de refaire le coup"}, {"start": 480.48, "duration": 1.08, "text": "que j'ai fait pour la Norvège."}, {"start": 482.16, "duration": 1.2, "text": "En rentrant du Cap-Nord,"}, {"start": 483.36, "duration": 0.32, "text": "il a fallu,"}, {"start": 483.68, "duration": 0.64, "text": "je m'arrête en Suède"}, {"start": 484.32, "duration": 0.92, "text": "pour changer le pneu arrière,"}, {"start": 485.24, "duration": 0.52, "text": "je l'avais flingué"}, {"start": 485.76, "duration": 0.72, "text": "à force de faire le coup."}, {"start": 487.08, "duration": 0.32, "text": "Donc,"}, {"start": 487.4, "duration": 1.12, "text": "ça m'a coûté encore un bras,"}, {"start": 488.72, "duration": 1.64, "text": "300 euros."}, {"start": 491.68, "duration": 0.16, "text": "Enfin,"}, {"start": 493.04, "duration": 0.2, "text": "bref."}, {"start": 494.88, "duration": 0.24, "text": "Donc,"}, {"start": 495.72, "duration": 0.28, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 496.36, "duration": 0.8, "text": "dans l'ensemble,"}, {"start": 497.16, "duration": 0.84, "text": "le pneu est très bien."}, {"start": 498.0, "duration": 0.92, "text": "encore une fois,"}, {"start": 498.92, "duration": 1.32, "text": "on est sur du haut de gamme"}, {"start": 500.24, "duration": 0.44, "text": "quand même."}, {"start": 501.24, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Voilà."}, {"start": 502.8, "duration": 0.4, "text": "Alors,"}, {"start": 503.2, "duration": 0.08, "text": "moi,"}, {"start": 503.28, "duration": 0.64, "text": "ce que j'aime bien,"}, {"start": 503.92, "duration": 1.2, "text": "c'est qu'on a un bon feeling"}, {"start": 505.12, "duration": 0.68, "text": "avec le pneu."}, {"start": 505.8, "duration": 0.8, "text": "C'est vrai que tu n'es pas surpris"}, {"start": 506.6, "duration": 1.76, "text": "parce que dans les conversations,"}, {"start": 508.36, "duration": 1.12, "text": "dans les commentaires que vous me faites,"}, {"start": 509.48, "duration": 0.24, "text": "certains,"}, {"start": 509.96, "duration": 0.96, "text": "ça revient souvent."}, {"start": 510.92, "duration": 2.2, "text": "ça revient."}, {"start": 513.12, "duration": 0.56, "text": "Par moment,"}, {"start": 514.52, "duration": 1.32, "text": "certains,"}, {"start": 516.08, "duration": 1.44, "text": "certains n'aiment pas les pneus"}, {"start": 517.52, "duration": 1.04, "text": "où tu as le sentiment"}, {"start": 518.56, "duration": 0.72, "text": "que la moto,"}, {"start": 519.28, "duration": 0.64, "text": "elle tombe d'un coup."}, {"start": 522.88, "duration": 0.24, "text": "Alors,"}, {"start": 523.12, "duration": 0.88, "text": "ce qu'on peut comprendre,"}, {"start": 524.0, "duration": 0.8, "text": "ça peut être surprenant."}, {"start": 526.96, "duration": 1.52, "text": "Tu commences à coucher de la bécane"}, {"start": 528.48, "duration": 0.64, "text": "et puis pour un coup,"}, {"start": 529.12, "duration": 0.72, "text": "elle y va toute seule"}, {"start": 529.84, "duration": 1.28, "text": "ou plus vite"}, {"start": 531.12, "duration": 0.96, "text": "que ce que tu aurais voulu."}, {"start": 532.64, "duration": 0.32, "text": "Et donc,"}, {"start": 532.96, "duration": 0.12, "text": "là,"}, {"start": 533.08, "duration": 0.52, "text": "tout d'un coup,"}, {"start": 533.6, "duration": 1.2, "text": "ça peut mettre"}, {"start": 534.8, "duration": 1.48, "text": "un petit coup de pression."}, {"start": 536.28, "duration": 2.12, "text": "voilà."}, {"start": 538.88, "duration": 0.28, "text": "Alors,"}, {"start": 539.16, "duration": 1.2, "text": "à contrario d'autres,"}, {"start": 540.8, "duration": 0.76, "text": "la mise sur l'angle,"}, {"start": 541.56, "duration": 1.32, "text": "elle est fluide"}, {"start": 542.92, "duration": 1.0, "text": "et raisonnée,"}, {"start": 543.92, "duration": 0.32, "text": "on va dire."}, {"start": 544.4, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Voilà,"}, {"start": 544.64, "duration": 0.6, "text": "donc progressive."}, {"start": 546.12, "duration": 1.36, "text": "C'est vraiment très agréable."}, {"start": 547.68, "duration": 0.32, "text": "Après,"}, {"start": 548.24, "duration": 0.44, "text": "on a,"}, {"start": 549.12, "duration": 1.0, "text": "au niveau de la gomme,"}, {"start": 550.12, "duration": 1.44, "text": "on a une technologie bigomme"}, {"start": 551.56, "duration": 1.96, "text": "avec un renforcement"}, {"start": 553.52, "duration": 0.96, "text": "de la bande de roulement,"}, {"start": 554.48, "duration": 1.0, "text": "comme beaucoup maintenant,"}, {"start": 555.48, "duration": 0.2, "text": "d'ailleurs."}, {"start": 557.36, "duration": 0.6, "text": "C'est pour les motards"}, {"start": 557.96, "duration": 0.44, "text": "comme moi."}, {"start": 560.72, "duration": 0.28, "text": "Voilà,"}, {"start": 561.0, "duration": 0.68, "text": "encore pas assez solide"}, {"start": 561.68, "duration": 0.72, "text": "la bande de roulement."}, {"start": 563.12, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Mais,"}, {"start": 564.6, "duration": 0.2, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 564.8, "duration": 0.6, "text": "a priori,"}, {"start": 565.4, "duration": 0.68, "text": "on est sur un pneu"}, {"start": 566.08, "duration": 1.32, "text": "avec une bonne technologie,"}, {"start": 567.4, "duration": 1.12, "text": "avec une carcasse,"}, {"start": 569.28, "duration": 1.2, "text": "en acier aussi."}, {"start": 570.72, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Bon,"}, {"start": 571.92, "duration": 0.6, "text": "j'ai regardé un peu"}, {"start": 572.52, "duration": 0.84, "text": "les caractéristiques."}, {"start": 573.6, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Ça,"}, {"start": 574.36, "duration": 0.4, "text": "bon,"}, {"start": 574.76, "duration": 0.64, "text": "ils ont tous des noms"}, {"start": 575.4, "duration": 1.44, "text": "plus ou moins différents,"}, {"start": 577.12, "duration": 0.44, "text": "mais j'ai l'impression"}, {"start": 577.56, "duration": 0.44, "text": "qu'au final,"}, {"start": 578.56, "duration": 0.56, "text": "on a à peu près"}, {"start": 579.12, "duration": 1.0, "text": "les mêmes choses de partout."}, {"start": 580.52, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Voilà."}, {"start": 581.16, "duration": 0.52, "text": "J'ai l'impression"}, {"start": 581.68, "duration": 0.44, "text": "qu'au niveau"}, {"start": 582.12, "duration": 0.68, "text": "de la conception,"}, {"start": 582.8, "duration": 0.36, "text": "en tous les cas,"}, {"start": 583.16, "duration": 0.64, "text": "de la philosophie,"}, {"start": 583.8, "duration": 1.4, "text": "on serait sur un road 6 GT,"}, {"start": 585.2, "duration": 0.28, "text": "tu vois,"}, {"start": 585.48, "duration": 0.2, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 586.4, "duration": 2.0, "text": "avec une technologie renforcée"}, {"start": 588.4, "duration": 1.64, "text": "pour avaler des kilomètres."}, {"start": 590.48, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Bon,"}, {"start": 590.68, "duration": 0.28, "text": "moi,"}, {"start": 590.96, "duration": 0.48, "text": "personnellement,"}, {"start": 591.44, "duration": 0.68, "text": "ça ne m'a pas réussi,"}, {"start": 592.36, "duration": 0.2, "text": "enfin,"}, {"start": 592.8, "duration": 0.48, "text": "pas mal,"}, {"start": 593.28, "duration": 0.4, "text": "on va dire."}, {"start": 593.68, "duration": 1.4, "text": "un road 6 GT,"}, {"start": 595.32, "duration": 1.04, "text": "j'ai mis 7000 bornes,"}, {"start": 596.36, "duration": 0.4, "text": "il était,"}, {"start": 596.76, "duration": 0.28, "text": "bon,"}, {"start": 597.6, "duration": 0.44, "text": "pas le bol."}, {"start": 598.6, "duration": 0.8, "text": "Et c'est la bande de roulement"}, {"start": 599.4, "duration": 0.96, "text": "qui reçoit à chaque fois,"}, {"start": 601.0, "duration": 0.8, "text": "c'est sûr que la moto"}, {"start": 601.8, "duration": 0.88, "text": "est très coupleuse"}, {"start": 602.68, "duration": 2.12, "text": "et relativement bas"}, {"start": 604.8, "duration": 0.52, "text": "dans les tours,"}, {"start": 605.32, "duration": 0.52, "text": "entre guillemets."}, {"start": 605.84, "duration": 1.96, "text": "Et c'est vrai que dès que tu lances"}, {"start": 607.8, "duration": 0.56, "text": "la bécane"}, {"start": 608.36, "duration": 1.24, "text": "et que tu tires dessus,"}, {"start": 609.64, "duration": 0.52, "text": "forcément,"}, {"start": 610.16, "duration": 0.64, "text": "tu arraches la gomme"}, {"start": 610.8, "duration": 1.4, "text": "et tout d'un coup,"}, {"start": 612.48, "duration": 1.12, "text": "il reste moins une gomme."}, {"start": 616.48, "duration": 0.92, "text": "J'ai vu des commentaires"}, {"start": 617.52, "duration": 0.6, "text": "comme quoi,"}, {"start": 618.24, "duration": 0.64, "text": "certains,"}, {"start": 619.16, "duration": 0.6, "text": "disaient,"}, {"start": 619.76, "duration": 0.76, "text": "le pneu rail,"}, {"start": 620.52, "duration": 0.6, "text": "c'est-à-dire qu'une fois"}, {"start": 621.12, "duration": 0.72, "text": "que tu es sur l'angle,"}, {"start": 622.12, "duration": 0.6, "text": "tu n'en sors plus."}, {"start": 622.96, "duration": 0.2, "text": "Voilà,"}, {"start": 623.84, "duration": 0.88, "text": "ça ne va pas partir"}, {"start": 624.72, "duration": 0.68, "text": "à droite à gauche."}, {"start": 626.8, "duration": 0.56, "text": "Notamment,"}, {"start": 627.36, "duration": 1.12, "text": "une petite info quand même,"}, {"start": 629.68, "duration": 1.6, "text": "j'avais remarqué pour ma part"}, {"start": 631.28, "duration": 1.48, "text": "que le Road 6"}, {"start": 632.84, "duration": 1.08, "text": "de chez Michelin,"}, {"start": 634.8, "duration": 0.88, "text": "quand le pneu est arrivé"}, {"start": 635.68, "duration": 0.8, "text": "un peu en fin de vie,"}, {"start": 638.96, "duration": 1.16, "text": "j'ai vraiment trouvé"}, {"start": 640.12, "duration": 2.24, "text": "que ses qualités d'adhérence"}, {"start": 642.36, "duration": 0.56, "text": "étaient très,"}, {"start": 642.92, "duration": 0.92, "text": "très dégradées."}, {"start": 643.84, "duration": 1.12, "text": "J'ai fait deux petites glissades."}, {"start": 646.68, "duration": 0.24, "text": "Bon,"}, {"start": 646.92, "duration": 0.24, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 647.28, "duration": 0.24, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 647.52, "duration": 2.6, "text": "je ne sais pas"}, {"start": 650.2, "duration": 3.04, "text": "si à ce moment-là,"}, {"start": 653.48, "duration": 0.6, "text": "ce n'est pas de bol"}, {"start": 654.08, "duration": 2.16, "text": "parce que c'était la route,"}, {"start": 656.24, "duration": 0.48, "text": "parce que si,"}, {"start": 656.72, "duration": 0.4, "text": "parce que là,"}, {"start": 657.12, "duration": 0.48, "text": "je n'en sais rien."}, {"start": 658.12, "duration": 0.4, "text": "Mais enfin,"}, {"start": 658.52, "duration": 0.96, "text": "j'ai remarqué quand même"}, {"start": 659.48, "duration": 1.0, "text": "une dégradation nette"}, {"start": 660.84, "duration": 0.6, "text": "que je n'ai pas eue"}, {"start": 661.44, "duration": 1.36, "text": "sur le Metzeler Rotec 02."}, {"start": 663.36, "duration": 0.88, "text": "Même quand le pneu"}, {"start": 664.24, "duration": 0.92, "text": "a été bien dégradé"}, {"start": 665.16, "duration": 1.04, "text": "quand il était en fin de vie,"}, {"start": 666.52, "duration": 0.84, "text": "le pneu continue"}, {"start": 667.36, "duration": 0.68, "text": "à être nickel."}, {"start": 668.24, "duration": 0.24, "text": "Voilà."}, {"start": 669.76, "duration": 0.36, "text": "Donc voilà,"}, {"start": 670.12, "duration": 0.68, "text": "je voulais vous faire remonter"}, {"start": 670.8, "duration": 0.56, "text": "cette info,"}, {"start": 671.36, "duration": 1.12, "text": "ça me semblait un peu important."}, {"start": 672.48, "duration": 0.2, "text": "parfois."}, {"start": 674.44, "duration": 1.16, "text": "Bridgestone nous livre ici"}, {"start": 675.64, "duration": 0.6, "text": "un pneu"}, {"start": 676.24, "duration": 2.12, "text": "avec quelques avancées technologiques"}, {"start": 678.36, "duration": 0.72, "text": "comme par exemple"}, {"start": 679.12, "duration": 1.68, "text": "le Nano ProTech,"}, {"start": 681.6, "duration": 1.44, "text": "une technologie d'optimisation"}, {"start": 683.04, "duration": 1.08, "text": "au niveau moléculaire"}, {"start": 684.12, "duration": 1.24, "text": "qui lie davantage"}, {"start": 685.36, "duration": 1.68, "text": "les molécules de caoutchouc"}, {"start": 687.04, "duration": 0.76, "text": "et la silice."}, {"start": 688.24, "duration": 1.44, "text": "Associée à la Silica Ridge,"}, {"start": 689.92, "duration": 1.76, "text": "un enrichissement à la silice"}, {"start": 691.68, "duration": 0.52, "text": "pour un grippe"}, {"start": 692.2, "duration": 1.32, "text": "plus élevé sur ce sol mouillé"}, {"start": 693.52, "duration": 1.68, "text": "ou à basse température."}, {"start": 695.2, "duration": 0.72, "text": "Même quand le pneu"}, {"start": 695.92, "duration": 1.12, "text": "donc n'est pas encore chaud."}, {"start": 698.08, "duration": 0.76, "text": "Côté structure,"}, {"start": 699.56, "duration": 0.92, "text": "une ceinture croisée"}, {"start": 700.48, "duration": 0.36, "text": "à l'avant"}, {"start": 700.84, "duration": 2.12, "text": "qui apporte de la flexibilité"}, {"start": 702.96, "duration": 1.16, "text": "permet au pneu"}, {"start": 704.12, "duration": 1.12, "text": "de s'adapter"}, {"start": 705.24, "duration": 0.56, "text": "aux motos"}, {"start": 705.8, "duration": 1.24, "text": "à poids très variés."}, {"start": 707.04, "duration": 1.52, "text": "Avec un dessin optimisé,"}, {"start": 708.56, "duration": 0.84, "text": "Bridgestone nous promet"}, {"start": 709.4, "duration": 0.64, "text": "une longévité"}, {"start": 710.04, "duration": 0.32, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 710.56, "duration": 0.72, "text": "comme je l'ai dit,"}, {"start": 711.28, "duration": 0.56, "text": "de 47%"}, {"start": 712.24, "duration": 1.36, "text": "par rapport au T32."}, {"start": 714.4, "duration": 1.0, "text": "Ce qui est énorme"}, {"start": 715.64, "duration": 1.6, "text": "si la promesse est tenue."}, {"start": 718.52, "duration": 1.56, "text": "Avec une polyvalence accrue,"}, {"start": 720.08, "duration": 1.4, "text": "ce pneu ne sera pas décliné"}, {"start": 721.48, "duration": 0.68, "text": "en version GT"}, {"start": 722.16, "duration": 1.44, "text": "car il est déjà conçu"}, {"start": 723.6, "duration": 0.56, "text": "pour les motos"}, {"start": 724.16, "duration": 1.2, "text": "de plus de 300 kg."}, {"start": 725.76, "duration": 0.8, "text": "Côté confort,"}, {"start": 726.56, "duration": 1.04, "text": "c'est franchement agréable."}, {"start": 727.6, "duration": 1.24, "text": "On ressent cette mise"}, {"start": 728.84, "duration": 0.76, "text": "sur l'angle"}, {"start": 729.6, "duration": 1.04, "text": "vraiment naturelle."}, {"start": 730.64, "duration": 0.68, "text": "Un ressenti"}, {"start": 731.32, "duration": 0.92, "text": "vraiment très agréable."}, {"start": 732.88, "duration": 0.52, "text": "En résumé,"}, {"start": 734.48, "duration": 1.0, "text": "Bridgestone nous propose"}, {"start": 735.48, "duration": 0.8, "text": "avec ce T33"}, {"start": 736.28, "duration": 1.28, "text": "une optimisation globale,"}, {"start": 738.12, "duration": 0.8, "text": "une chimie avancée"}, {"start": 738.92, "duration": 1.44, "text": "pour minimiser l'usure,"}, {"start": 740.96, "duration": 1.28, "text": "une structure de carcasse"}, {"start": 742.24, "duration": 1.04, "text": "à la fois flexible"}, {"start": 743.28, "duration": 0.52, "text": "et stable"}, {"start": 743.8, "duration": 2.48, "text": "et des sculptures affinées"}, {"start": 746.28, "duration": 1.24, "text": "pour garantir"}, {"start": 747.52, "duration": 0.72, "text": "la sécurité"}, {"start": 748.24, "duration": 0.84, "text": "sur le sol mouillé"}, {"start": 749.08, "duration": 1.28, "text": "sans sacrifier"}, {"start": 750.36, "duration": 0.68, "text": "le kilométrage."}, {"start": 752.48, "duration": 0.76, "text": "Comme d'habitude,"}, {"start": 753.24, "duration": 0.68, "text": "dans quelques mois,"}, {"start": 753.92, "duration": 0.68, "text": "je ne manquerai pas"}, {"start": 754.6, "duration": 0.88, "text": "de vous faire un retour"}, {"start": 755.6, "duration": 1.36, "text": "sur ce pneu,"}, {"start": 757.0, "duration": 0.68, "text": "notamment au niveau"}, {"start": 757.68, "duration": 0.88, "text": "de la longévité"}, {"start": 758.56, "duration": 1.48, "text": "parce qu'au niveau du reste,"}, {"start": 760.56, "duration": 0.68, "text": "effectivement,"}, {"start": 761.24, "duration": 1.16, "text": "on est sur un très bon pneu."}, {"start": 762.68, "duration": 0.72, "text": "Tu l'auras compris."}, {"start": 764.12, "duration": 0.36, "text": "Et puis,"}, {"start": 764.48, "duration": 0.52, "text": "j'en profite"}, {"start": 765.0, "duration": 0.8, "text": "pour vous dire"}, {"start": 765.8, "duration": 1.64, "text": "que j'ai un site internet"}, {"start": 767.56, "duration": 1.48, "text": "lcdmh.com"}, {"start": 769.04, "duration": 0.8, "text": "sur lequel on va pouvoir"}, {"start": 769.84, "duration": 0.88, "text": "retrouver des roadtrips,"}, {"start": 771.08, "duration": 1.16, "text": "des petites infos."}, {"start": 772.44, "duration": 1.08, "text": "J'essaye de publier"}, {"start": 773.52, "duration": 1.96, "text": "les traces que j'ai faites"}, {"start": 775.48, "duration": 0.88, "text": "en roadtrip"}, {"start": 776.36, "duration": 0.96, "text": "pour donner éventuellement"}, {"start": 777.32, "duration": 0.72, "text": "des idées de voyage"}, {"start": 778.04, "duration": 1.36, "text": "ou de balade."}, {"start": 779.8, "duration": 0.6, "text": "Et puis,"}, {"start": 780.4, "duration": 0.52, "text": "en même temps,"}, {"start": 780.92, "duration": 0.88, "text": "j'ai regroupé aussi"}, {"start": 781.8, "duration": 1.32, "text": "tout ce qui concerne"}, {"start": 783.12, "duration": 0.64, "text": "les codes promo"}, {"start": 783.8, "duration": 2.24, "text": "Que j'ai pu glaner à droite à gauche tout au fils du temps"}, {"start": 787.28, "duration": 0.92, "text": "tout ça sur ce page"}, {"start": 788.2, "duration": 1.2, "text": "où je vous parlerai"}, {"start": 789.4, "duration": 1.44, "text": "du matériel du Bivouac."}, {"start": 791.32, "duration": 0.48, "text": "D'ici là,"}, {"start": 792.36, "duration": 0.8, "text": "merci et à bientôt."}]}